{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ParsedLocation"},{"type":"text","value":" type represents a parsed location in TanStack Router. It contains a lot of useful information about the current location, including the pathname, search params, hash, location state, and route masking information."}]},{"type":"code","value":"interface ParsedLocation {\n  href: string\n  pathname: string\n  search: TFullSearchSchema\n  searchStr: string\n  state: ParsedHistoryState\n  hash: string\n  maskedLocation?: ParsedLocation\n  unmaskOnReload?: boolean\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `ParsedLocation` type represents a parsed location in TanStack Router. It contains a lot of useful information about the current location, including the pathname, search params, hash, location state, and route masking information.\n\n```tsx\ninterface ParsedLocation {\n  href: string\n  pathname: string\n  search: TFullSearchSchema\n  searchStr: string\n  state: ParsedHistoryState\n  hash: string\n  maskedLocation?: ParsedLocation\n  unmaskOnReload?: boolean\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ParsedLocationType\ntitle: ParsedLocation type\n---\n\nThe `ParsedLocation` type represents a parsed location in TanStack Router. It contains a lot of useful information about the current location, including the pathname, search params, hash, location state, and route masking information.\n\n```tsx\ninterface ParsedLocation {\n  href: string\n  pathname: string\n  search: TFullSearchSchema\n  searchStr: string\n  state: ParsedHistoryState\n  hash: string\n  maskedLocation?: ParsedLocation\n  unmaskOnReload?: boolean\n}\n```\n"}
